@Notification_ServiceAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{Notification_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Get Notification History
GET {{Notification_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/history
Accept: application/json

### Send Email Notification
POST {{Notification_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/email
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
	"recipientEmail": "customer@example.com",
	"subject": "Policy Renewal Reminder",
	"body": "Your policy renewal is due in 7 days."
}

### Send Email Notification (Simulated Failure)
POST {{Notification_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/email
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
	"recipientEmail": "fail-user@example.com",
	"subject": "Failure simulation",
	"body": "This should return Failed status for retry flow testing."
}

### Send SMS Notification
POST {{Notification_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/sms
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
	"recipientPhone": "+919999999999",
	"message": "Your claim has been approved."
}

### Send Push Notification
POST {{Notification_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/push
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}

{
	"recipientDeviceToken": "device-token-123",
	"title": "Claim Update",
	"message": "Your survey visit is scheduled for tomorrow."
}

### Retry Failed Notification
POST {{Notification_ServiceAPI_HostAddress}}/api/notifications/{{notificationId}}/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{jwtToken}}
